  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Camera oriented release: raw YUV frame input (FromNv21, FromNv12, FromI420) feeds preview buffers straight to the reader with no conversion; tilted documents up to about 8 degrees are detected and read; capture hints on results and video sessions say why a frame failed (too small, cut off, blurry, glare, low contrast) so apps can guide the user.",
